{"id":"647793","name":"煎蛋午餐肉拌菠菜","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/647793/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"煎蛋","amount":"1个"},{"name":"午餐肉","amount":"60g"},{"name":"菠菜","amount":"150g"}],"sub":[{"name":"食用油","amount":"小许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"菠菜洗净切段焯水。","img":"images/647793/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"开锅即可。","img":"images/647793/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"过冷水，攥干水分备用。","img":"images/647793/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"大蒜处理干净，放食盐和鸡精。","img":"images/647793/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"捣成蒜泥。","img":"images/647793/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放陈醋。","img":"images/647793/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"images/647793/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"切午餐肉。","img":"images/647793/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"热锅冷油。","img":"images/647793/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"油热把午餐肉放进来。","img":"images/647793/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"煎微黄。","img":"images/647793/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"放蛋液。","img":"images/647793/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"把鸡蛋煎熟，午餐肉翻面。","img":"images/647793/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"用木铲分成小块，取出来用刀切条最好，我嫌弃弄的案板都是油，就用木铲分成小块了。","img":"images/647793/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"午餐肉和鸡蛋放菠菜里。","img":"images/647793/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"倒入蒜泥。","img":"images/647793/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"拌匀即可。","img":"images/647793/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/647793/step_18.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}